      {
        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "In this post, you train Qwen3 three ways on a single trn2.48xlarge .",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/train-qwen3-on-aws-trainium-with-torchtitan/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-21T20:00:22.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-23T00:37:32.433Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "The second method switches to torchtitan’s native Qwen3 by changing config.model_spec .",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/train-qwen3-on-aws-trainium-with-torchtitan/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-21T20:00:22.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-23T00:37:32.433Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "python3 -c \"import torchtitan, torchtitan_neuron; print(torchtitan.__version__, torchtitan_neuron.__file__)\"",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/train-qwen3-on-aws-trainium-with-torchtitan/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-21T20:00:22.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-23T00:37:32.433Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "-m torchtitan.train --module neuron_qwen3 --config v5_qwen3_4b",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/train-qwen3-on-aws-trainium-with-torchtitan/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-21T20:00:22.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-23T00:37:32.433Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "This command launches 64 training processes, one for each logical NeuronCore. --module neuron_qwen3 imports the local config module. --config v5_qwen3_4b selects the configuration function.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/train-qwen3-on-aws-trainium-with-torchtitan/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-21T20:00:22.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-23T00:37:32.433Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "This example starts from qwen3_32b() because the tested torchtitan build does not provide a generic qwen3_4b() config builder.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/train-qwen3-on-aws-trainium-with-torchtitan/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-21T20:00:22.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-23T00:37:32.433Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "-m torchtitan.train --module neuron_qwen3 --config native_qwen3_4b",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/train-qwen3-on-aws-trainium-with-torchtitan/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-21T20:00:22.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-23T00:37:32.433Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "from torchtitan_neuron.models.qwen3.config_registry import qwen3_nki_moe_config",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/train-qwen3-on-aws-trainium-with-torchtitan/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-21T20:00:22.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-23T00:37:32.433Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "-m torchtitan.train --module neuron_qwen3 --config nki_qwen3_30b_a3b",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/train-qwen3-on-aws-trainium-with-torchtitan/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-21T20:00:22.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-23T00:37:32.433Z"
      },
      {
